From f6f581f2f6cbaaf12fa3c3ece65e57dcdb7e2bef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 47/58] clashapi, trafficcontrol: a failed listen, a failed UI,
 records of connections

A failed listen of the external controller does not fail the start, an external UI that fails to
unpack leaves the one served, the record of a connection is not written while it is listed, and a
tracker's metadata drops the sniffer state and the DNS answers.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  abac3a212 clashapi: a failed listen of the external controller does not fail the start
  9c9bc81ed trafficcontrol: drop the sniffer state and the DNS answers from a tracker's metadata
  23dc434d6 clashapi: do not write to the record of a connection while it is listed
  f70882d02 clashapi: an external UI that fails to unpack leaves the one served
  41f832ef9 patches: adapt to sing-box 1.14.4

Pdk-Feature: clashapi
Pdk-Zone: other
Pdk-Layer: 04
